# TO CURSOR — AUTH/SIGNUP CHANGE POLICY (NON-NEGOTIABLE)

You must not edit auth/signup-related code on assumptions. Follow this process every time.

---

## 1) STOP RULE (effective immediately)

You are **not allowed** to edit anything touching these paths unless you have **first read** the required docs and can cite the exact snippets that justify the change:

**Auth/Signup sensitive paths:**
- `app/routers/public_signup.py`
- `app/routers/auth.py`
- `app/utils/password.py`
- `app/utils/otp.py`
- Any middleware that affects tenant resolution (tenant_context, host/headers)
