## 4) ACCEPTANCE GATES (must pass before considering auth change done)

Run these and confirm (paste outputs if doing a PR/commit):

1. **Tenant routing:**  
   `curl -i https://demo.truckerp.me/api/v1/public/tenant/demo` → **200**

2. **Password login works:**  
   `curl -i https://demo.truckerp.me/api/v1/auth/login` with valid creds → **200**

3. **Forgot-password enabled:**  
   `curl -i https://demo.truckerp.me/api/v1/auth/forgot-password` with body → **200** (NOT 410)

4. **Reset sets password and login works:**  
   Complete reset flow; then login with new password → **200**

(Use actual host/URL for your environment; demo.truckerp.me is the example.)

